          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Today</span><span class="info-stat-val">Shanghai is a provincial-level municipality of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a>, divided into 16 districts, and the country's most populous city.</span></div>
